• Run & Background (! or $): Run one-liner shell commands directly (! pnpm build, ! curl -I
  localhost:8080) with inline output toast.
• Port / Process Killer: :kill 3000 or :kill node with fuzzy PID selection.
• Hitting Tab on any search result reveals secondary keyboard actions:
      • App: Enter = Open | Cmd+Enter = Reveal in Finder | Cmd+O = Open with... | Cmd+R = Restart
      app.
      • File: Enter = Open | Cmd+C = Copy path | Cmd+Shift+C = Copy file content | Cmd+Delete =
      Move to Trash.
      • URL: Enter = Open default | Cmd+1/2 = Open in specific browser / profile.



